#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:3881
msgid "When something fails inside Babilim, send an error report to the Babilim service so it can be published as a public issue on GitHub. The report is sent as coming from this site, with the same authentication as every other request to the Babilim service. The service publishes only the error code and versions as a public issue on GitHub; the public issue contains no site address, content or file paths. Off by default."
msgstr "Wanneer iets binne Babilim misluk, stuur 'n foutverslag na die Babilim-diens sodat dit as 'n openbare kwessie op GitHub gepubliseer kan word. Die verslag word gestuur asof dit van hierdie webwerf af kom, met dieselfde verifikasie as elke ander versoek aan die Babilim-diens. Die diens publiseer slegs die foutkode en weergawes as 'n openbare kwessie op GitHub; die openbare kwessie bevat geen webwerfadres, inhoud of lêerpaaie nie. Standaard af."

